 demonstrates whether the schema survives\n  benchmark-suite version bumps and states the evolution rule; the prototype\n  is committed only after this validation passes.\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n- HLR-3 (P0): results persisted and linked to the Model Registry version —\n  gated by this investigation's outcome.\n- HLR-8 (P2): cost/duration metadata in the result record — schema designed\n  here.\n- HLR-5 (P1): Dashboard per-benchmark score display and comparison — the\n  rendered fields are defined by this schema.\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":47092,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-ab93c870253e5ee8","agent_id":"a1f24615f07c0d279","session_id":"544b3ec5-06d3-46ca-8ea6-a4c49a0f57f5","uuid":"1ba2f79a-efbc-40a9-9e80-ef986f6b23f7","timestamp":"2026-10-22T16:14:05.629Z","subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-9002"}
