{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"chatcmpl-75080b57-57db-4791-8c8b-3c0b246169f8","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"chatcmpl-tool-accef5db32794c1c","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/private/var/folders/h5/l8qslbp55w5621qf9ngsh5jc0000gn/T/epic-RHAISTRAT-9002-twq9v194/artifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9002-E004.md","content":"# Standard benchmark suite catalog and packaging\n\n## Description\n\nThis epic delivers the out-of-the-box standard benchmark suites for the\nplatform evaluation capability. Standard suites exposed through lm-eval task\nnames (e.g. MMLU, ARC, HellaSwag) become selectable evaluation targets, with\neach suite packaged according to its redistribution licensing classification:\nbundled with the platform where redistribution is permitted, or delivered via\na documented customer-side fetch mechanism where it is not.\n\n## Scope\n\n- Build the standard suite catalog: the set of lm-eval task configurations\n  selectable when launching an evaluation of a served model.\n- Package redistributable suites so they work in disconnected environments\n  without customer-side dataset setup.\n- Provide the documented fetch path for suites whose datasets cannot be\n  redistributed, with clear failure messaging when a suite is not yet fetched.\n- Align catalog contents with the per-suite licensing classification produced\n  by the benchmark dataset licensing investigation.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- A user launching an evaluation of a model served on the platform can select\n  each named standard suite (MMLU, ARC, HellaSwag) from the catalog.\n- Suites classified redistributable run against a served model in a\n  disconnected environment with no customer-side dataset setup.\n- Suites classified customer-fetched have a documented fetch mechanism, and\n  attempting to run one before fetching produces an actionable error.\n- No suite is bundled in violation of its dataset license.\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n- HLR-2 (P0): standard benchmark suites available out of the box.\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":49167,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-ab93c870253e5ee8","agent_id":"a1f24615f07c0d279","session_id":"544b3ec5-06d3-46ca-8ea6-a4c49a0f57f5","uuid":"fb25b1b2-cbd6-4e1f-b3bb-ef8b1bec7f44","timestamp":"2026-10-22T16:14:27.342Z","subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-9002"}
