hem (fail or branch on thresholds).\n51\t- Ensure the component works within DataSciencePipelinesApplication-managed\n52\t  project pipelines.\n53\t\n54\t## Acceptance Criteria\n55\t\n56\t- A Data Science Pipeline run can include an evaluation step that launches an\n57\t  evaluation of a served model and waits for its completion.\n58\t- Per-benchmark scores are available as step outputs to downstream pipeline\n59\t  steps.\n60\t- A pipeline can be authored so a subsequent step fails or branches when a\n61\t  score is below a configured threshold.\n62\t- The evaluation step runs within a project's Data Science Pipelines\n63\t  application without manual cluster-level setup.\n64\t\n65\t## HLR Traceability\n66\t\n67\t- HLR-6 (P1): evaluations can be embedded as a step in a Data Science\n68\t  Pipeline so promotion flows can gate on scores.\n69\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-95d5379a6620c5ce","agent_id":"a36f2c95917215dda","session_id":"544b3ec5-06d3-46ca-8ea6-a4c49a0f57f5","uuid":"256298bd-94ab-4a4a-a737-5310cb60f70b","timestamp":"2026-10-22T16:20:38.412Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-95370f38caeb71a0","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9002 decomposition"}
