{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-bee28d9b6e39b7eb","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tepic_id: RHAISTRAT-9002-E007\n3\ttitle: Llama Stack eval provider backed by platform evaluation\n4\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-9002\n5\tcomponent: Llama Stack\n6\tteam: RHOAI GenAI\n7\ttype: Implementation\n8\tpriority: P1\n9\tdependencies:\n10\t- RHAISTRAT-9002-E001\n11\tgated_by: RHAISTRAT-9002-E001\n12\tgate_failure_impact:\n13\t  action: rewrite\n14\t  fallback_approach: If the execution engine investigation selects a different backend\n15\t    surface, the provider is rewritten to back onto the selected platform evaluation\n16\t    service API.\n17\tai_signals:\n18\t  change_specificity: 0\n19\t  pattern_precedent: 1\n20\t  adapter_pattern: 1\n21\t  existing_foundation: 1\n22\t  open_questions: -1\n23\t  external_dependency: -1\n24\t  human_process_gates: 0\n25\t  repo_access: 1\n26\t  architecture_claims: 1\n27\timplementation_type: null\n28\tinvestigation_signals: null\n29\tai_implementability: High\n30\tai_implementability_score: 3\n31\tjira_key: null\n32\tbranch: null\n33\t---\n34\t# Llama Stack eval provider backed by platform evaluation\n35\t\n36\t## Description\n37\t\n38\tThis epic wires Llama Stack's eval provider API to the platform evaluation\n39\tcapability, so agents and applications built on a LlamaStackDistribution get\n40\tevaluation results from the platform's evaluation service instead of an\n41\texternal one. The upstream eval provider API exists but no production eval\n42\tprovider is wired in the platform distribution yet; this epic provides that\n43\tprovider, backed by whatever execution surface the execution engine\n44\tarchitecture decision selected.\n45\t\n46\t## Scope\n47\t\n48\t- Implement the eval provider plugin for the platform's Llama Stack\n49\t  distribution, following Llama Stack's provider-plugin model.\n50\t- Back the provider with the platform evaluation capability (launching\n51\t  evaluations of served models and returning results in the canonical result\n52\t  schema) per the selected execution path.\n53\t- Contribute or carry the provider integration in the midstream Llama Stack\n54\t  distribution, coordinating with upstream where required.\n55\t\n56\t## Acceptance Criteria\n57\t\n58\t- An agent or application on a platform LlamaStackDistribution invoking the\n59\t  eval provider API receives evaluation results sourced from the platform\n60\t  evaluation capability.\n61\t- The provider launches evaluations against models served on the platform\n62\t  (KServe endpoints or the Llama Stack distribution's own served models).\n63\t- Returned results conform to the canonical evaluation result schema.\n64\t- The provider is configured per distribution through the existing provider\n65\t  plugin configuration surface.\n66\t\n67\t## HLR Traceability\n68\t\n69\t- HLR-7 (P1): Llama Stack's eval provider API is backed by the platform\n70\t  evaluation service, so agents/apps built on Llama Stack get the same\n71\t  results.\n72\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-ae0f731533efb227","agent_id":"aea37a3d6f9aa207c","session_id":"544b3ec5-06d3-46ca-8ea6-a4c49a0f57f5","uuid":"61069df9-4207-4682-803d-a4c621ea779c","timestamp":"2026-10-22T16:30:11.300Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-bee28d9b6e39b7eb","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Revise RHAISTRAT-9002 decomposition"}
