{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-9cdb3045ddba3333","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tepic_id: RHAISTRAT-9002-E006\n3\ttitle: Evaluation step for Data Science Pipelines\n4\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-9002\n5\tcomponent: Data Science Pipelines\n6\tteam: RHOAI Pipelines\n7\ttype: Implementation\n8\tpriority: P1\n9\tdependencies:\n10\t- RHAISTRAT-9002-E001\n11\tgated_by: RHAISTRAT-9002-E001\n12\tgate_failure_impact:\n13\t  action: rewrite\n14\t  fallback_approach: If the execution engine investigation selects a different launch\n15\t    surface, the pipeline component is rewritten to call the selected evaluation API.\n16\tai_signals:\n17\t  change_specificity: 1\n18\t  pattern_precedent: 1\n19\t  adapter_pattern: 0\n20\t  existing_foundation: 1\n21\t  open_questions: -1\n22\t  external_dependency: 1\n23\t  human_process_gates: 1\n24\t  repo_access: 1\n25\t  architecture_claims: 1\n26\timplementation_type: null\n27\tinvestigation_signals: null\n28\tai_implementability: High\n29\tai_implementability_score: 6\n30\tjira_key: null\n31\tbranch: null\n32\t---\n33\t# Evaluation step for Data Science Pipelines\n34\t\n35\t## Description\n36\t\n37\tThis epic makes evaluation embeddable as a step in a Data Science Pipeline, so\n38\tpromotion flows can gate on benchmark scores: a pipeline run launches an\n39\tevaluation of a served model against a benchmark suite and exposes the\n40\tresulting scores as step outputs that downstream gating logic can consume.\n41\tHumans still make promotion decisions; the pipeline only gates.\n42\t\n43\t## Scope\n44\t\n45\t- Provide a Kubeflow Pipelines (v2) component that launches an evaluation of a\n46\t  specified served model against a specified benchmark suite through the\n47\t  platform's chosen execution path (per the execution engine architecture\n48\t  decision).\n49\t- Expose evaluation status and per-benchmark scores as component outputs so\n50\t  subsequent pipeline steps can gate on them (fail or branch on thresholds).\n51\t- Ensure the component works within DataSciencePipelinesApplication-managed\n52\t  project pipelines.\n53\t\n54\t## Acceptance Criteria\n55\t\n56\t- A Data Science Pipeline run can include an evaluation step that launches an\n57\t  evaluation of a served model and waits for its completion.\n58\t- Per-benchmark scores are available as step outputs to downstream pipeline\n59\t  steps.\n60\t- A pipeline can be authored so a subsequent step fails or branches when a\n61\t  score is below a configured threshold.\n62\t- The evaluation step runs within a project's Data Science Pipelines\n63\t  application without manual cluster-level setup.\n64\t\n65\t## HLR Traceability\n66\t\n67\t- HLR-6 (P1): evaluations can be embedded as a step in a Data Science\n68\t  Pipeline so promotion flows can gate on scores.\n69\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-ae0f731533efb227","agent_id":"aea37a3d6f9aa207c","session_id":"544b3ec5-06d3-46ca-8ea6-a4c49a0f57f5","uuid":"b19c6add-7f97-42a1-97ca-7661c11eb7e8","timestamp":"2026-10-22T16:30:12.254Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-9cdb3045ddba3333","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Revise RHAISTRAT-9002 decomposition"}
