t- Provide the documented fetch path for suites whose datasets cannot be\n52\t  redistributed, with clear failure messaging when a suite is not yet fetched.\n53\t- Align catalog contents with the per-suite licensing classification produced\n54\t  by the benchmark dataset licensing investigation.\n55\t\n56\t## Acceptance Criteria\n57\t\n58\t- A user launching an evaluation of a model served on the platform can select\n59\t  each named standard suite (MMLU, ARC, HellaSwag) from the catalog.\n60\t- Suites classified redistributable run against a served model in a\n61\t  disconnected environment with no customer-side dataset setup.\n62\t- Suites classified customer-fetched have a documented fetch mechanism, and\n63\t  attempting to run one before fetching produces an actionable error.\n64\t- No suite is bundled in violation of its dataset license.\n65\t\n66\t## HLR Traceability\n67\t\n68\t- HLR-2 (P0): standard benchmark suites available out of the box.\n69\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-8623395f67fec7e3","agent_id":"ac4d1cf20445318f5","session_id":"544b3ec5-06d3-46ca-8ea6-a4c49a0f57f5","uuid":"2387c2e4-8d3d-4db0-82ba-f974489e10df","timestamp":"2026-10-22T16:32:25.187Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-b5edde6f16119486","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Re-review RHAISTRAT-9002"}
