re\n51\t  decision).\n52\t- Expose evaluation status and per-benchmark scores as component outputs so\n53\t  subsequent pipeline steps can gate on them (fail or branch on thresholds).\n54\t- Ensure the component works within DataSciencePipelinesApplication-managed\n55\t  project pipelines.\n56\t\n57\t## Acceptance Criteria\n58\t\n59\t- A Data Science Pipeline run can include an evaluation step that launches an\n60\t  evaluation of a served model and waits for its completion.\n61\t- Per-benchmark scores are available as step outputs to downstream pipeline\n62\t  steps.\n63\t- A pipeline can be authored so a subsequent step fails or branches when a\n64\t  score is below a configured threshold.\n65\t- The evaluation step runs within a project's Data Science Pipelines\n66\t  application without manual cluster-level setup.\n67\t\n68\t## HLR Traceability\n69\t\n70\t- HLR-6 (P1): evaluations can be embedded as a step in a Data Science\n71\t  Pipeline so promotion flows can gate on scores.\n72\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-8623395f67fec7e3","agent_id":"ac4d1cf20445318f5","session_id":"544b3ec5-06d3-46ca-8ea6-a4c49a0f57f5","uuid":"71fe3e86-e711-439b-b96c-f89faa4134af","timestamp":"2026-10-22T16:32:30.721Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-bd375703f0e32569","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Re-review RHAISTRAT-9002"}
