ding which suites are bundled and\n54\t    which require customer-side dataset fetch.\n55\t  - Authoring custom evaluation tasks (own datasets and metrics) and running\n56\t    them through the same flow.\n57\t  - Reading results: per-benchmark scores, cost/duration metadata, and\n58\t    side-by-side model version comparison in the Dashboard.\n59\t  - Embedding evaluation as a pipeline step and gating promotion flows on\n60\t    scores.\n61\t  - Consuming evaluation through the Llama Stack eval provider API.\n62\t- Coordinate with the documentation toolchain and review process used by the\n63\t  platform docs.\n64\t\n65\t## Acceptance Criteria\n66\t\n67\t- A user can follow the documentation to launch an evaluation of a served\n68\t  model against a standard suite without consulting other sources.\n69\t- A custom-task authoring guide walks through defining a custom evaluation\n70\t  task with its own dataset and metric and running it through the standard\n71\t  flow.\n72\t- Documentation covers result interpretation, model version comparison,\n73\t  pipeline gating, and the Llama Stack eval provider.\n74\t- All evaluation documentation is technically reviewed against the\n75\t  implemented behavior by the owning engineers before publication.\n76\t\n77\t## HLR Traceability\n78\t\n79\t- HLR-9 (P2): product documentation covers the evaluation workflow end to\n80\t  end, including custom task authoring.\n81\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-8623395f67fec7e3","agent_id":"ac4d1cf20445318f5","session_id":"544b3ec5-06d3-46ca-8ea6-a4c49a0f57f5","uuid":"6a81419e-f26c-4017-a83b-b2323f375790","timestamp":"2026-10-22T16:32:32.841Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-834ec7333358a662","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Re-review RHAISTRAT-9002"}
